      "dedupe_key": "blackheath-christmas-fair|2026-11-15|blackheath-halls",
      "description": "Join us for our biggest and best Age Exchange Christmas Fair yet! This year we’re bringing you more stalls, more gifts, more festive fun, and more activities for children and families. Browse a fantastic range of handmade crafts, Christmas gifts, books, treats, and festive goodies while supporting your local charity. Our Café will be open throughout the day, serving delicious seasonal refreshments, cakes, and light lunches. Highlights include: More local artisan and community stalls Children’s activities and festive fun Charity Christmas cards now on sale Books, gifts, decorations, and stocking fillers Festive refreshments in our café Raffle and seasonal surprises Come along, soak up the Christmas atmosphere, and support the work of Age Exchange in your community. Everyone is welcome! £3 entry / U16s Free – all proceeds support Age Exchange, their Creative Dementia programme & Blackheath Community Library age-exchange.org.uk Charity No. 326 899",
