  {
    "date_text": "Sat 30 Jan, 6.30pm SOLD OUT",
    "event": {
      "address": "23 Lee Road, London SE3 9RQ",
      "all_day": false,
      "category": "music",
      "dedupe_key": "burns-night-2027|2027-01-30|blackheath-halls",
      "description": "This event has SOLD OUT. Please contact the Box Office to be added to the waiting list. Raise a glass to poet Robert Burns and join us for a night of ceilidh dancing, live music and fabulous food. We’ve brought together some of Blackheath Village’s finest: Hand Made Food, Ellis Butchers, Rockpool Fishmongers, Mons Cheesemongers, Everest Inn and Boulangerie Jade to lay on a feast fit for a Bard. Squinty McGinty’s Band will get toes tapping with live music and a rousing ceilidh. Kilts optional, good spirits guaranteed! Booking Information You can book either an entire table for 10 people or individual seats. Please note that Tables 1,2, 8 and 9 will be removed for the ceilidh. There will be some additional seating available if you would rather watch than dance! If you would like to be seated with specific people, please book all tickets together in a single transaction. Unfortunately, we cannot guarantee seating together for separately booked tickets. To accommodate all guests, we may occasionally need to rearrange table allocations. If this affects your booking, we will contact you in advance to let you know. Sponsored by",
      "ends_at": "2027-01-30T23:00:00Z",
      "image_url": "https://www.blackheathhalls.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Burns-Night-Leaflet-394-x-220-px-1.jpg",
