      "description": "*Priority Booking for Patrons & Platinum Patrons opens from 10am Mon 2 November* On general sale from 10am Mon 9 November Back again for another wonderful year, enjoy a glittering evening of operatic favourites to raise money for our Community Opera project. The evening will include performances from our Opera Patron, Ailish Tynan and the Blackheath Halls Youth Choir with more singers to be announced. Event Timings: 6.30pm Doors open for a glass of fizz 7pm Performance begins The audience will be seated at tables and presented with Prosecco on arrival and a light supper. Booking Information: Guests can either book an entire table for 10 people or individual seats at a table of their choice. If you would like to book a table for more than 10 people, please call the Box Office on 020 8463 0100 to see if we can accommodate your needs. Bookings close at 5.00pm on Thursday 18th February.",
